.SH REVISION HISTORY COMMANDS
.PP
.B Not shipped.
The
.BR log ", " diff ", and " restore
subcommands and the
.B RevisionProvider
plumbing have been removed from this fork. pCloud's
.BR listrevisions / revertfile
endpoints are not exposed to third-party clients. See
.B docs/future-pcloud-clone-api.md
("Removed scaffolds") and the operations runbook section
.B "Recovering an older version of a file"
for the recommended recovery procedure (web UI revision history plus
.BR "pcloudc backup snapshot-restore" ).
